<title>BELGIUM: Belgolux trade surplus grew in Jan vs yr-ago.</title>
<headline>Belgolux trade surplus grew in Jan vs yr-ago.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Office released the following provisional data on trade in the Belgo-Luxembourg Economic Union (in billions of francs) -</p>
<p>    BELGOLUX TRADE		   Jan 1997  Dec 1996  Jan 1996</p>
<p>    Exports			    110.3     110.1	94.8</p>
<p>    Imports			    107.1 *    88.5	96.5</p>
<p>    Balance				3.1	21.5	-1.7</p>
<p>NOTE - * The Office said its method for calculating imports had been completely revised starting with January 1997.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
